      "user": "ProtonX",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Very enjoyable for a little session. Repairing old tech in a quaint little Japanese town with some unravelling plot line that somehow has you knowing more than you should, certainly takes this type of game in a fun and relaxing direction. It can get a little repetitive especially when you have to mill through a tone of online orders just to unlock a new piece of equipment or get a new license, all just to move on with the story, but it's not a major detriment."
    },
    {
      "game": "Metal Gear Solid: Master Collection Vol. 2",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/17505/450x258/metal-gear-solid-master-collection-vol-2-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1788631200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/17505-buy-metal-gear-solid-master-collection-vol-2-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Adam Owsianka",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/21639275-1772399671.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "War has changed. It's no longer about nations, ideologies, or ethnicity. It's an endless series of proxy battles fought by mercenaries and machines. War - and its consumption of life - has become a well-oiled machine. Genetic control. Information control. Emotion control. Battlefield control. Everything is monitored and kept under control. War has changed. The age of deterrence has become the age of control... All in the name of averting catastrophe from weapons of mass destruction. And he who controls the battlefield. .. controls history. War has changed. When the battlefield is under total control... War becomes routine."
    },
    {
      "game": "Call of Duty: Ghosts Digital Hardened Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/9529/450x258/call-of-duty-ghosts-digital-hardened-edition-digital-hardened-edition-xbox-one-xbox-series-x-s-game-microsoft-store-europe-cover.jpg?v=1788631200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/9529-buy-call-of-duty-ghosts-digital-hardened-edition-digital-hardened-edition-xbox-one-xbox-series-x-s-game-microsoft-store-europe/",
